days) as of the census date.
36 Temporarily absent A person who has been temporarily absent from the administrative unit of usual
residence for less than 6 months (183 days) as of the census date.
37 Temporarily present
A person who is present in the administrative unit of enumeration that is other
than the administrative unit of his/ her usual residence for less than 6 months
(183 days) as of the census date.
